msgstr ":guilabel:`Pricio`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:56 ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:98
msgid ":doc:`Taxes <taxes>` (if applicable)"
msgstr ":doc:`Impuestos <taxes>` (si aplican)"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:58
msgid "To access the product catalog and view all items in an organized display, click :doc:`Catalog </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/product_catalog>`. When the products and quantities are selected, click :guilabel:`Back to Invoice` to return to the invoice; the selected catalog items will appear in the invoice lines."
msgstr "Haga clic en :doc:`Catálogo </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/product_catalog>` para acceder al catálogo de productos y ver todos los artículos en una vista organizada. Una vez que haya seleccionado los productos y las cantidades, haga clic en :guilabel:`Regresar a la factura`. Los artículos que haya seleccionado en el catálogo aparecerán en las líneas de la factura."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:181
msgid "To display the total amount of the invoice in words, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings` and activate the :guilabel:`Total amount of invoice in letters` option."
msgstr "Para que el importe total de la factura aparezca en palabras, vaya a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Ajustes` y active la opción :guilabel:`Importe total de una factura con letra`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:185
msgid "The :guilabel:`Journal Items` tab displays the accounting entries created. Additional invoice information such as the :guilabel:`Customer Reference`, :guilabel:`Payment Reference`, :doc:`Fiscal Positions <taxes/fiscal_positions>`, :doc:`Incoterms <customer_invoices/incoterms>`, and more can be added or modified in the :guilabel:`Other Info` tab."
msgstr "La pestaña :guilabel:`Apuntes contables` muestra los asientos contables creados. En la pestaña :guilabel:`Otra información` podrá añadir o modificar información adicional de la factura, como la :guilabel:`Referencia del cliente`, la :guilabel:`Referencia de pago`, las :doc:`Posiciones fiscales <taxes/fiscal_positions>`, los :doc:`Incoterms <customer_invoices/incoterms>`, entre otras cosas."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:191
msgid "Odoo initially creates invoices in :guilabel:`Draft` status. Draft invoices have no accounting impact until they are :ref:`confirmed <accounting/invoice/confirmation>`."
msgstr "Al inicio, Odoo crea las facturas en estado de :guilabel:`Borrador`. Las facturas en borrador solo tienen impacto contable después de :ref:`confirmarlas <accounting/invoice/confirmation>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:195 ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/overview.rst:47
msgid ":doc:`/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/proforma`"
msgstr ":doc:`/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/proforma`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:200
msgid "Invoice confirmation"
msgstr "Confirmación de facturas"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:202
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Confirm` when the invoice is completed. The invoice's status changes to :guilabel:`Posted`, and a journal entry is generated based on the invoice configuration. On confirmation, Odoo assigns each invoice a unique number from a defined :doc:`sequence <customer_invoices/sequence>`."
msgstr "Haga clic en :guilabel:`Confirmar` cuando haya completado la factura. El estado de la factura cambia a :guilabel:`Contabilizado` y se genera un asiento contable según la configuración de la factura. Al confirmar, Odoo asigna a cada factura un número único a partir de una :doc:`secuencia <customer_invoices/sequence>` definida."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:208
msgid "Once confirmed, an invoice can no longer be updated. Click :guilabel:`Reset to draft` if changes are needed."
msgstr "Una vez que haya confirmado la factura no podrá actualizarla. Haga clic en :guilabel:`Restablecer a borrador` si necesita realizar algún cambio."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:210
msgid "If required, invoices and other journal entries can be locked once posted using the :ref:`Secure posted entries with hash <data-inalterability/restricted>` feature."
msgstr "Si es necesario, las facturas y otros asientos contables se pueden bloquear una vez contabilizados mediante la función :ref:`Asegurar asientos contabilizados con hash <data-inalterability/restricted>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:251
msgid "Invoice sending"
msgstr "Envío de facturas"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:260
msgid "Sending letters in Odoo requires :doc:`In-App Purchase (IAP) <../../essentials/in_app_purchase>` credit or tokens."
msgstr "Para enviar cartas en Odoo se necesitan créditos o tokens de :doc:`compra dentro de la aplicación (IAP) <../../essentials/in_app_purchase>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:263
msgid "To send the invoice to the customer, navigate back to the invoice record and follow these steps:"
msgstr "Para enviar la factura al cliente, regrese al registro de la factura y siga estos pasos:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:265 ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:137 ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/jordan.rst:177
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Send`."
msgstr "Haga clic en :guilabel:`Enviar`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:271
msgid "The document layout can be changed at any time in the general settings."
msgstr "El diseño del documento se puede cambiar en cualquier momento en los ajustes generales."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:272
msgid "To add a QR code for banking app payments to the invoice, enable the :guilabel:`QR Code` option in the :guilabel:`Configure Your Document Layout` window. To modify this option, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`Customer Payments` section, and enable/disable the :guilabel:`QR Codes` option."
msgstr "Para añadir un código QR a la factura para pagos con aplicaciones bancarias, habilite la opción :guilabel:`Código QR` en la ventana :guilabel:`Configure el diseño de su documento`. Para modificar esta opción, vaya a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Ajustes`, desplácese hasta la sección :guilabel:`Pagos de clientes` y habilite/deshabilite la opción :guilabel:`Códigos QR`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:277
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Send` window:"
msgstr "En la ventana :guilabel:`Enviar`:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:279
msgid "If a preferred :guilabel:`Invoice sending` method was set in the contact form, it is selected by default. Select another one if needed."
msgstr "Si se configuró un método preferido de :guilabel:`Envío de facturas` en el formulario de contacto, este se selecciona de forma predeterminada. Seleccione otro si es necesario."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:281
msgid "If no preferred :guilabel:`Invoice sending` method was set in the contact form, select the method to use for sending the invoice to the customer."
msgstr "Si no se configuró ningún método preferido de :guilabel:`Envío de facturas` en el formulario de contacto, seleccione el método que desea utilizar para enviar la factura al cliente."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:284
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Send` if the :guilabel:`by Email` option is selected, or click :guilabel:`Download`."
msgstr "Haga clic en :guilabel:`Enviar` si la opción :guilabel:`Por correo electrónico` está seleccionada, o haga clic en :guilabel:`Descargar`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:290
msgid "Sending multiple invoices"
msgstr "Envío de varias facturas"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:292
msgid "To send and print multiple invoices, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Invoices`, select them in the :guilabel:`Invoices` list view and click :guilabel:`Send`. The :guilabel:`Send` window displays the selected invoice sending methods based on the preferred method set."
msgstr "Para enviar e imprimir varias facturas, vaya a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Clientes --> Facturas`, selecciónelas en la vista de lista :guilabel:`Facturas` y haga clic en :guilabel:`Enviar`. La ventana :guilabel:`Enviar` muestra los métodos de envío de facturas seleccionados según el método preferido configurado."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:297
msgid "A banner is added to the selected invoices to indicate they are part of an ongoing send and print batch. This helps prevent the process from being triggered manually again, as it may take some time to complete for exceptionally large batches."
msgstr "Se añade un aviso a las facturas seleccionadas para indicar que forman parte de un lote de envío e impresión en curso. Esto ayuda a evitar que el proceso se active manualmente de nuevo, ya que puede tardar un tiempo en completarse en el caso de lotes excepcionalmente grandes."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:301
msgid "To check all invoices that have not yet been sent, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Invoices`. In the :guilabel:`Invoices` list view, click into the search bar and filter on :guilabel:`Not Sent`."
msgstr "Para consultar todas las facturas que aún no se han enviado, vaya a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Clientes --> Facturas`. En la vista de lista :guilabel:`Facturas`, haga clic en la barra de búsqueda y filtre por :guilabel:`No enviado`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:308 ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:138
msgid "Payment and reconciliation"
msgstr "Pagos y conciliación"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:310
msgid "In Odoo, an invoice is considered :guilabel:`Paid` when the associated accounting entry has been reconciled with a corresponding bank transaction."
msgstr "En Odoo, una factura se considera :guilabel:`Pagada` cuando el asiento contable asociado se ha conciliado con la transacción bancaria correspondiente."

