#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:94
msgid "All invoices and vendor bills can then be sent directly using Peppol."
msgstr "A partir de ese momento, todas las facturas y facturas de proveedor se pueden enviar directamente mediante Peppol."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:97
msgid "To update the :guilabel:`Primary contact email`, modify it and click :guilabel:`Update`."
msgstr "Para actualizar el :guilabel:`Correo electrónico de contacto principal`, modifíquelo y haga clic en :guilabel:`Actualizar`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:98
msgid "If you are using an access point from a previous provider, make sure to deregister from it first, then register with your new access point, unless it's Hermes (BOSA). If using Hermes (BOSA), no action is needed; the migration is handled automatically."
msgstr "Si está utilizando un punto de acceso de un proveedor anterior, asegúrese de darse de baja primero y luego regístrese con su nuevo punto de acceso, a menos que sea Hermes (BOSA). Si utiliza Hermes (BOSA), no es necesario realizar ninguna acción, ya que la migración se gestiona automáticamente."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:103
msgid "To manually trigger the scheduled action used to check the Peppol registration status, enable :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>`, open the Settings app, go to :menuselection:`Settings --> Technical --> Scheduled actions`, and search for :guilabel:`Peppol: update participant status`. Open the scheduled action, then click :guilabel:`Run Manually`."
msgstr "Para activar manualmente la acción planificada utilizada para comprobar el estado del registro de Peppol, habilite el :ref:`modo de desarrollador <developer-mode>`, abra la aplicación Ajustes, vaya a :menuselection:`Ajustes --> Técnico --> Acciones planificadas` y busque :guilabel:`Peppol: update participant status`. Abra la acción planificada y haga clic en :guilabel:`Ejecutar manualmente`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:107
msgid "To try Peppol without sending real data, enable demo mode by selecting :guilabel:`Odoo Demo ID` as the Peppol endpoint identifier. To switch back to production mode, change the :guilabel:`account_peppol.edi.mode` system parameter to `prod` mode before activating Peppol in production."
msgstr "Para probar Peppol sin enviar datos reales, habilite el modo de demostración seleccionando :guilabel:`Odoo Demo ID` como identificador de punto final de Peppol. Para volver al modo de producción, cambie el parámetro del sistema :guilabel:`account_peppol.edi.mode` al modo `prod` antes de activar Peppol en producción."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:111
msgid "For advanced testing on Peppol's dedicated test network, use the test mode by setting the :guilabel:`account_peppol.edi.mode` system parameter to `test`. This option is intended for experienced users only."
msgstr "Para realizar pruebas avanzadas en la red de pruebas dedicada de Peppol, utilice el modo de prueba configurando el parámetro del sistema :guilabel:`account_peppol.edi.mode` en `test`. Esta opción está destinada únicamente a usuarios experimentados."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:118
msgid "Contact verification"
msgstr "Verificar contactos"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:120
msgid "Before sending an invoice to a contact using Peppol, make sure the contact is registered as a Peppol participant. To do so, follow these steps:"
msgstr "Antes de enviar una factura a un contacto mediante Peppol, asegúrese de que el contacto esté registrado como participante de Peppol. Para ello, siga estos pasos:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:123
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Customers` and access the customer's form."
msgstr "Vaya a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Clientes --> Clientes` y acceda al formulario del cliente."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:124
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Accounting tab`, check the following information in the :guilabel:`Customer invoices` section:"
msgstr "En la :guilabel:`pestaña Contabilidad`, compruebe la siguiente información en la sección :guilabel:`Facturas de cliente`:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:127
msgid ":guilabel:`eInvoice format`: Select the relevant format."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Formato de factura electrónica`: seleccione el formato correspondiente."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:128
msgid "Using the :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(down arrow)` icon, make sure the relevant country-specific Peppol endpoint identifier is selected in the dropdown list, then enter the customer's endpoint identifier, usually a Company Registry or VAT number."
msgstr "Con el icono :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(flecha hacia abajo)`, asegúrese de que el identificador de punto final de Peppol correspondiente al país esté seleccionado en la lista desplegable y, a continuación, introduzca el identificador de punto final del cliente, por lo general, un número de registro mercantil o de IVA."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:145
msgid "While Odoo prefills the endpoint number based on the information available for a contact, verifying these details with the contact is recommended."
msgstr "Aunque Odoo completa previamente el número de punto final según la información disponible del contacto, se recomienda verificar estos datos con el contacto."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:151
msgid "Send invoices"
msgstr "Enviar facturas"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:153
msgid "Posted invoices to be sent via Peppol are marked as :guilabel:`Ready to send` in the invoice's :guilabel:`Peppol status` field."
msgstr "Las facturas contabilizadas que se enviarán mediante Peppol se marcan como :guilabel:`Listo para enviar` en el campo :guilabel:`Estado de Peppol` de la factura."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:157
msgid "All invoices that are ready to be sent via Peppol can be viewed in the following ways:"
msgstr "Puede consultar todas las facturas listas para enviarse mediante Peppol de las siguientes maneras:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:162
msgid "In the Accounting dashboard, click :guilabel:`Peppol ready invoices` on the relevant sales journal."
msgstr "En el tablero de contabilidad, haga clic en :guilabel:`Facturas listas para Peppol` en el diario de ventas correspondiente."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:165
msgid "To send the invoice to the customer via Peppol, click :guilabel:`Send` on the confirmed invoice form. In the :guilabel:`Print & Send` window, enable the :guilabel:`by Peppol` option and click :guilabel:`Send`."
msgstr "Para enviar la factura al cliente mediante Peppol, haga clic en :guilabel:`Enviar` en el formulario de la factura confirmada. En la ventana :guilabel:`Imprimir y enviar`, habilite la opción :guilabel:`por Peppol` y haga clic en :guilabel:`Enviar`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:170
msgid ":ref:`Multiple invoices <accounting/invoice/sending-multiple-invoices>` can also be sent in batches via Peppol."
msgstr "También se pueden enviar :ref:`varias facturas <accounting/invoice/sending-multiple-invoices>` por lotes mediante Peppol."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:172
msgid "Set the preferred :ref:`Invoice sending <accounting/invoice/sending>` method for a customer to :guilabel:`by Peppol` in the :guilabel:`Customer Invoices` section of the customer form's :guilabel:`Accounting` tab."
msgstr "Configure el método preferido de :ref:`Envío de facturas <accounting/invoice/sending>` de un cliente como :guilabel:`por Peppol` en la sección :guilabel:`Facturas de cliente` de la pestaña :guilabel:`Contabilidad` del formulario del cliente."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:176
msgid "The status is updated to :guilabel:`Done` once the invoices have been successfully delivered to the contact's access point."
msgstr "El estado se actualiza a :guilabel:`Hecho` una vez que las facturas se han entregado correctamente al punto de acceso del contacto."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:180
msgid "To manually trigger the scheduled action used to check the invoices' status, go to the Accounting dashboard and click :guilabel:`Fetch Peppol invoice status` on the corresponding sales journal."
msgstr "Para activar manualmente la acción planificada utilizada para comprobar el estado de las facturas, vaya al tablero de contabilidad y haga clic en :guilabel:`Obtener estado de factura de Peppol` en el diario de ventas correspondiente."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:195
msgid "Receive vendor bills"
msgstr "Recibir las facturas de proveedor"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:197
msgid "New documents received via Peppol are checked multiple times a day. Received documents are automatically imported into the purchase journal set in the :guilabel:`PEPPOL Electronic Invoicing` section, and corresponding vendor bills are created as drafts and appear in the vendor bills list view."
msgstr "Los documentos nuevos recibidos mediante Peppol se comprueban varias veces al día. Los documentos recibidos se importan automáticamente al diario de compras configurado en la sección :guilabel:`Facturación electrónica PEPPOL` y las facturas de proveedor correspondientes se crean como borradores y aparecen en la vista de lista de facturas de proveedor."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:203
msgid "To manually trigger the scheduled action to retrieve incoming Peppol documents, go to the Accounting dashboard and click :guilabel:`Fetch from Peppol` on the main Peppol purchase journal."
msgstr "Para activar manualmente la acción planificada para recuperar los documentos entrantes de Peppol, vaya al tablero de contabilidad y haga clic en :guilabel:`Obtener de Peppol` en el diario de compras principal de Peppol."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/jordan.rst:132 ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/vietnam.rst:130
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr "Haga clic en :guilabel:`Guardar`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:217
msgid "Peppol deregistration from Odoo"
msgstr "Baja de Peppol en Odoo"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:219
msgid "Only one Peppol receiver registration can be active for each Peppol endpoint identifier at a time. To stop using Odoo as the Peppol access point, e.g., to switch to another provider or reconfigure the registration for a new database, you must first deregister from Peppol. To do so, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`PEPPOL Electronic Invoicing` section, click :guilabel:`Remove from Peppol`, and confirm."
msgstr "Solo puede haber un registro de receptor de Peppol activo por cada identificador de punto final de Peppol a la vez. Para dejar de usar Odoo como punto de acceso de Peppol, por ejemplo, para cambiar a otro proveedor o reconfigurar el registro para una nueva base de datos, primero debe darse de baja de Peppol. Para ello, vaya a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Ajustes`, desplácese hasta la sección :guilabel:`Facturación electrónica PEPPOL`, haga clic en :guilabel:`Eliminar de Peppol` y confirme."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:225
msgid "Once removed, the Peppol registration is deleted from the database, and documents can no longer be sent or received via Peppol in Odoo."
msgstr "Una vez eliminado, el registro de Peppol se borra de la base de datos y ya no se podrán enviar ni recibir documentos mediante Peppol en Odoo."

