msgid "**Supported formats**: Odoo supports the XML :abbr:`UBL (Universal Business Language)` format, compliant with European Standard EN 16931, meeting the requirements for public sector e-invoicing in Luxembourg. It also facilitates e-invoicing through the Peppol network, ensuring interoperability for cross-border invoicing."
