#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:112
msgid "In the first warehouse operation, `8` tables are received at `$10` each. The average cost is calculated using the :ref:`formula <inventory/avg_cost/formula>`:"
msgstr "En la primera operación del almacén, recibe `8` mesas a `$10` cada una. El coste promedio se calcula usando la :ref:`fórmula <inventory/avg_cost/formula>`:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:115
msgid ""
"Avg~Cost = \\frac{0 + 8 \\times $10}{8} = \\frac{$80}{8} = $10\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Coste~promedio = \\frac{0 + 8 \\times $10}{8} = \\frac{$80}{8} = $10\n"
"\n"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:118
msgid "Since the *incoming quantity* of tables is `8` and the *purchase price* for each is `$10`,"
msgstr "Ya que la *cantidad entrante* de mesas es `8` y el *precio de compra* de cada una es de `$10`,  "

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:119
msgid "The inventory value in the numerator is evaluated to `$80`;"
msgstr "El valor de inventario en el numerador se evalúa en `$80`; "

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:120
msgid "`$80` is divided by the total amount of tables to store, `8`;"
msgstr "`$80` se divide entre la cantidad total de mesas por almacenar, `8`;"

