#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:173
msgid "Odoo allows companies under the `Deferred Goods and Services Tax (DGST) scheme <https://www.ato.gov.au/businesses-and-organisations/gst-excise-and-indirect-taxes/gst/in-detail/rules-for-specific-transactions/international-transactions/deferred-gst?=redirected_deferredGSTscheme>`_ to automate their deferred GST flows."
msgstr "Odoo permite a las empresas acogidas al `régimen de Impuesto sobre Bienes y Servicios Diferido (DGST) <https://www.ato.gov.au/businesses-and-organisations/gst-excise-and-indirect-taxes/gst/in-detail/rules-for-specific-transactions/international-transactions/deferred-gst?=redirected_deferredGSTscheme>`_ automatizar sus flujos de GST diferido."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:183
msgid "By default, a tax (*100% DGST*, inactive by default) and an account (*21340 Deferred GST Liability*) are available for Australian companies. Activate the tax by going to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Taxes`. Search for the :guilabel:`Name` `100% DGST` (remove the default filter if necessary), and click the :guilabel:`Activate` toggle switch."
msgstr "Por defecto, hay disponibles un impuesto (*100 % DGST*, inactivo de forma predeterminada) y una cuenta (*21340 Pasivo de GST diferido*) para las empresas australianas. Active el impuesto yendo a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Impuestos`. Busque el :guilabel:`Nombre` `100% DGST` (elimine el filtro predeterminado si es necesario) y haga clic en el interruptor :guilabel:`Activar`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:189
msgid "Flow"
msgstr "Flujo"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:192
msgid "1. Importing goods: purchase order and vendor bill"
msgstr "1. Importación de mercancías: pedido de compra y factura de proveedor"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:194
msgid "When importing goods from abroad, the GST liability can now be deferred for companies under the DGST scheme. On the purchase order, select the :guilabel:`0% TPS` tax (tax paid separately) for the relevant order lines."
msgstr "Al importar mercancías del extranjero, el pasivo de GST ahora se puede diferir para las empresas acogidas al régimen DGST. En el pedido de compra, seleccione el impuesto :guilabel:`0% TPS` (impuesto pagado por separado) en las líneas del pedido correspondientes."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:209
msgid "When the Australian Taxation Office (ATO) is advised electronically of the aggregated liability for the company by the Integrated Cargo System (ICS), the GST balance deferred during the previous month becomes available on the ATO's BAS portal."
msgstr "Cuando la Oficina Australiana de Impuestos (ATO) recibe de forma electrónica el aviso del pasivo agregado de la empresa a través del Integrated Cargo System (ICS), el saldo de GST diferido durante el mes anterior queda disponible en el portal BAS de la ATO."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:214
msgid "Odoo does not yet fetch the DGST balance automatically from the ATO. A manual entry with the liability amount needs to be created in Odoo. We recommend using a new journal for this purpose since deferrals will be recurring."
msgstr "Odoo aún no obtiene automáticamente el saldo de DGST de la ATO. Es necesario crear manualmente un asiento en Odoo con el importe del pasivo. Recomendamos utilizar un nuevo diario para este fin, ya que los diferimientos serán recurrentes."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:218
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Journal Entries --> New`. On the first journal item line, add the :guilabel:`Account` `21340 Deferred GST Liability` and the deferred GST balance as a :guilabel:`Credit`. To resume the example shown above, we credit $2,000 and save."
msgstr "Vaya a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Asientos contables --> Nuevo`. En la primera línea del apunte, añada la :guilabel:`Cuenta` `21340 Pasivo de GST diferido` y el saldo de GST diferido como :guilabel:`Haber`. Para retomar el ejemplo anterior, abonamos 2000 $ y guardamos."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:230
msgid "An auto-balancing line is created, along with journal items correctly assigning the right values in the BAS :guilabel:`Tax Grids`. Sections *G11*, *G18*, *7A*, and *ONLY* are updated correctly."
msgstr "Se crea una línea de contrapartida automática, junto con los apuntes que asignan correctamente los valores adecuados en las :guilabel:`Cuadrículas de impuestos` del BAS. Las secciones *G11*, *G18*, *7A* y *ONLY* se actualizan correctamente."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:247 ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/new_zealand.rst:147
msgid "Remittance advice"
msgstr "Aviso de pago"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:249
msgid "A remittance advice is a document used as proof of payment to a business. In Odoo, it can be accessed by going to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Vendors --> Payments`, selecting the payment(s), and clicking :menuselection:`Print --> Payment Receipt`."
msgstr "Un aviso de remesa es un documento que se utiliza como comprobante de pago a una empresa. En Odoo, se puede acceder a él yendo a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Proveedores --> Pagos`, seleccionando el o los pagos, y haciendo clic en :menuselection:`Imprimir --> Recibo de pago`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:263 ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:109 ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:170 ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/luxembourg.rst:70 ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/new_zealand.rst:168
msgid "E-invoicing"
msgstr "Facturación electrónica"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:268
msgid "Odoo is compliant with Australia's `Peppol requirements <https://peppol.org/learn-more/country-profiles/australia/>`_. Set up your customers and vendors by going to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Customers` or :menuselection:`Vendors --> Vendors`, selecting one, clicking the :guilabel:`Accounting` tab, and configuring the :guilabel:`Electronic Invoicing` section as needed."
msgstr "Odoo cumple con los `requisitos de Peppol <https://peppol.org/learn-more/country-profiles/australia/>`_ de Australia. Configure sus clientes y proveedores yendo a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Clientes --> Clientes` o :menuselection:`Proveedores --> Proveedores`, seleccionando uno, haciendo clic en la pestaña :guilabel:`Contabilidad` y configurando la sección :guilabel:`Facturación electrónica` según sea necesario."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:283
msgid "Validating an invoice or credit note for a partner on the Peppol network will download a compliant XML file that can be manually uploaded to your Peppol network. Odoo is currently in the process of becoming an access point for the ANZ region."
msgstr "Al validar una factura o un abono para un contacto de la red Peppol, se descargará un archivo XML conforme que se puede subir manualmente a su red Peppol. Odoo se encuentra actualmente en proceso de convertirse en punto de acceso para la región ANZ."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:288 ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/new_zealand.rst:192
msgid "Industry-specific features"
msgstr "Funciones específicas del sector"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:293 ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/new_zealand.rst:199
msgid "Buy Now, Pay Later solutions"
msgstr "Soluciones para comprar ahora y pagar después."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:295
msgid "*Buy Now, Pay Later* solutions are popular payment methods for eShops in Australia. Some of these solutions are available via `Stripe <https://stripe.com/en-au/payments/payment-methods>`_ and `AsiaPay <https://www.asiapay.com.au/payment.html#option>`_."
msgstr "Las soluciones de *compre ahora, pague después* son métodos de pago populares para las tiendas en línea en Australia. Algunas de estas soluciones están disponibles a través de `Stripe <https://stripe.com/en-au/payments/payment-methods>`_ y `AsiaPay <https://www.asiapay.com.au/payment.html#option>`_."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:300 ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:314
