#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:56
msgid "In :menuselection:`Settings --> Users & Companies --> Companies`, add your :guilabel:`PAN` and :guilabel:`GSTIN`. The PAN is essential for determining the type of taxpayer, while GSTIN is required for generating e-Invoices and E-waybills."
