#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:39
msgid "Open the :guilabel:`Settings` app, go to the :doc:`Companies <../../general/companies>` section, and click :ref:`Update Info <general/companies/company>`. Ensure the :guilabel:`NPWP` field contains the **Tax Identification Number**, as an e-Faktur cannot be generated from an invoice otherwise."
