#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:52
msgid ":guilabel:`Is PKP`: Check this box to allow e-Faktur generation for the partner."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Is PKP`: marque esta casilla para permitir la generación de e-Faktur para el contacto."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:53
msgid ":guilabel:`NPWP`: Enter the partner's Tax Identification Number."
msgstr ":guilabel:`NPWP`: introduzca el Número de Identificación Fiscal del contacto."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:54
msgid ":guilabel:`NIK`: If the partner does not have an :guilabel:`NPWP`, enter the :guilabel:`NIK` in the :guilabel:`Accounting` tab under :guilabel:`Indonesian taxes`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`NIK`: si el contacto no tiene un :guilabel:`NPWP`, introduzca el :guilabel:`NIK` en la pestaña :guilabel:`Accounting`, en :guilabel:`Indonesian taxes`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:62
msgid "To set a product's E-Faktur product code, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Products` and access the desired product form. In the :guilabel:`Indonesian Localization` section, select a code in the :guilabel:`E-Faktur Product code` field. By default, the code is set to :guilabel:`000000 - Barang`."
msgstr "Para establecer el código de producto E-Faktur, vaya a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Clientes --> Productos` y acceda al formulario del producto deseado. En la sección :guilabel:`Indonesian Localization`, seleccione un código en el campo :guilabel:`E-Faktur Product code`. De forma predeterminada, el código está establecido en :guilabel:`000000 - Barang`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:76
msgid ":guilabel:`E-Faktur product codes` are pre-generated by Odoo and cannot be edited. Select a code from the available options."
msgstr "Los :guilabel:`E-Faktur product codes` son generados previamente por Odoo y no se pueden editar. Seleccione un código de las opciones disponibles."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:82
msgid "E-Faktur UoM Code"
msgstr "Código UdM de E-Faktur"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:85
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Settings` to make sure the :guilabel:`Units of Measure` option has been enabled."
msgstr "Vaya a :menuselection:`Inventario --> Configuración --> Ajustes` para asegurarse de que la opción :guilabel:`Units of Measure` esté activada."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:88
msgid "To configure the :guilabel:`E-Faktur UoM code`, go to :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> UoM Categories`. Open a category and select the appropriate :guilabel:`E-Faktur UoM Code` from the options."
msgstr "Para configurar el :guilabel:`E-Faktur UoM code`, vaya a :menuselection:`Inventario --> Configuración --> UoM Categories`. Abra una categoría y seleccione el :guilabel:`E-Faktur UoM Code` correspondiente entre las opciones."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:114
msgid "Generate an E-Faktur XML"
msgstr "Generar un XML de E-Faktur"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:116
msgid "An e-Faktur can be created for an invoice if the customer's country is Indonesia and the :guilabel:`Is PKP` checkbox is enabled on their  :ref:`contact <localizations/indonesia/configuration-contacts>` form."
msgstr "Se puede crear un e-Faktur para una factura si el país del cliente es Indonesia y la casilla :guilabel:`Is PKP` está activada en su formulario de :ref:`contacto <localizations/indonesia/configuration-contacts>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:120
msgid "To generate an e-Faktur XML:"
msgstr "Para generar un XML de e-Faktur:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:122
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Invoices` and :ref:`create an invoice <accounting/invoice/creation>`."
msgstr "Vaya a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Clientes --> Facturas` y :ref:`cree una factura <accounting/invoice/creation>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:125
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Other Info` tab, under the :guilabel:`Electronic Tax` section, select a :guilabel:`Kode Transaksi` code."
msgstr "En la pestaña :guilabel:`Other Info`, en la sección :guilabel:`Electronic Tax`, seleccione un código :guilabel:`Kode Transaksi`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:129
msgid "The :guilabel:`Kode Transaksi` codes are pre-generated by Odoo and cannot be edited."
msgstr "Los códigos :guilabel:`Kode Transaksi` son generados previamente por Odoo y no se pueden editar."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:131
msgid "After confirming the invoice, click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Actions)` icon and select :guilabel:`Download e-faktur`."
msgstr "Después de confirmar la factura, haga clic en el icono :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Actions)` y seleccione :guilabel:`Download e-faktur`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:134
msgid "The downloaded XML file can then be uploaded to the Coretax system. After the file is generated, the :guilabel:`e-Faktur Document (Coretax)` field in the invoice's :guilabel:`Electronic Tax` section is populated automatically."
msgstr "El archivo XML descargado se puede subir posteriormente al sistema Coretax. Una vez generado el archivo, el campo :guilabel:`e-Faktur Document (Coretax)` de la sección :guilabel:`Electronic Tax` de la factura se completa automáticamente."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:147
msgid "To create a batch XML file for several invoices, select them in the invoice list view and choose :guilabel:`Download e-faktur` from the :guilabel:`Actions` menu."
msgstr "Para crear un archivo XML por lotes para varias facturas, selecciónelas en la vista de lista de facturas y elija :guilabel:`Download e-faktur` en el menú :guilabel:`Actions`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:151
msgid "The tax invoice number is generated by the Coretax system, not by Odoo."
msgstr "El número de factura fiscal lo genera el sistema Coretax, no Odoo."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:152
msgid "Once an e-Faktur XML file has been downloaded, it cannot be changed. Any subsequent download will retrieve the original file."
msgstr "Una vez descargado un archivo XML de e-Faktur, no se puede modificar. Cualquier descarga posterior recuperará el archivo original."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:158
msgid "QRIS QR code on invoices"
msgstr "Código QR de QRIS en las facturas"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:160
msgid "`QRIS <https://qris.online/homepage/>`_ is a digital payment system that allows customers to make payments by scanning the QR code from their preferred e-wallet."
msgstr "`QRIS <https://qris.online/homepage/>`_ es un sistema de pago digital que permite a los clientes realizar pagos escaneando el código QR desde su monedero electrónico preferido."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:164
msgid "According to the `QRIS API documentation <https://qris.online/api-doc/create-invoice.php>`_, QRIS expires after 30 minutes. Due to this restriction, the QR code is not included in reports sent to customers and is only available on the customer portal."
msgstr "Según la `documentación de la API de QRIS <https://qris.online/api-doc/create-invoice.php>`_, el QRIS caduca después de 30 minutos. Debido a esta restricción, el código QR no se incluye en los informes enviados a los clientes y solo está disponible en el portal de clientes."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:173 ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/singapore.rst:14 ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:88
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings`. Under the :guilabel:`Customer Payments` section, activate the :guilabel:`QR Codes` feature."
msgstr "Vaya a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Ajustes`. En la sección :guilabel:`Pagos del cliente`, active la opción :guilabel:`Códigos QR`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:179
msgid "QRIS bank account configuration"
msgstr "Configuración de la cuenta bancaria para QRIS"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:181
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Contacts --> Configuration --> Bank Accounts` and select the bank account for which you want to activate QRIS. Set the :guilabel:`QRIS API Key` and :guilabel:`QRIS Merchant ID` based on the information provided by QRIS."
msgstr "Vaya a :menuselection:`Contactos --> Configuración --> Bank Accounts` y seleccione la cuenta bancaria para la que desea activar QRIS. Configure la :guilabel:`QRIS API Key` y el :guilabel:`QRIS Merchant ID` según la información proporcionada por QRIS."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:186
msgid "The account holder's country must be set to `Indonesia` on its contact form."
msgstr "El país del titular de la cuenta debe estar establecido en `Indonesia` en su formulario de contacto."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:204 ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/singapore.rst:44
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Journals`, open the bank journal, then fill out the :guilabel:`Account Number` and :guilabel:`Bank` under the :guilabel:`Journal Entries` tab."
msgstr "Vaya a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Diarios`, abra el diario bancario, llene la información de :guilabel:`Número de cuenta` y :guilabel:`Banco` en la pestaña :guilabel:`Asientos contables`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:218
msgid "Issue invoices with QRIS QR codes"
msgstr "Emitir facturas con códigos QR de QRIS"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:220
msgid "When creating a new invoice, open the :guilabel:`Other Info` tab and set the :guilabel:`Payment QR-code` option to :guilabel:`QRIS`."
msgstr "Al crear una nueva factura, abra la pestaña :guilabel:`Other Info` y establezca la opción :guilabel:`Payment QR-code` en :guilabel:`QRIS`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:231
msgid "Ensure that the :guilabel:`Recipient Bank` is the one you configured, as Odoo uses this field to generate the QRIS QR code."
msgstr "Asegúrese de que el :guilabel:`Recipient Bank` sea el que configuró, ya que Odoo utiliza este campo para generar el código QR de QRIS."

