#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:158
msgid ":guilabel:`Identification`: Select the :guilabel:`ID Type` and enter the associated :guilabel:`Identification number` used to register for the digital certificate."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Identificación`: seleccione el :guilabel:`Tipo de identificación` e ingrese el :guilabel:`número de identificación` asociado utilizado para registrarse en el certificado digital."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:160
msgid ":guilabel:`Ind. Classification`: Input the 5-digit numeric code that represents the nature and activity of the business."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Clasificación ind.`: ingrese el código numérico de 5 dígitos que representa la naturaleza y la actividad de la empresa."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:166
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings`. In the :guilabel:`Malaysian Electronic Invoicing` section, select the relevant :guilabel:`MyInvois mode` based on the environment used for the company's MyInvois registration."
msgstr "Vaya a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Ajustes`. En la sección :guilabel:`Facturación electrónica de Malasia`, seleccione el :guilabel:`Modo MyInvois` correspondiente según el entorno utilizado para el registro de la empresa en MyInvois."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:170
msgid "Make sure to allow Odoo to process e-invoices by checking the box, then click :guilabel:`Register`."
msgstr "Asegúrese de permitir que Odoo procese las facturas electrónicas marcando la casilla y, a continuación, haga clic en :guilabel:`Registrar`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:173
msgid "To change the :abbr:`TIN (tax identification number)` reference, click :guilabel:`Unregister`, change the company's information and make sure the number registered on MyInvois matches, then :guilabel:`Register` again."
msgstr "Para cambiar la referencia del :abbr:`TIN (número de identificación fiscal)`, haga clic en :guilabel:`Cancelar registro`, modifique la información de la empresa, asegúrese de que el número coincida con el registrado en MyInvois y, a continuación, haga clic de nuevo en :guilabel:`Registrar`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:178
msgid "For taxpayers with a :abbr:`TIN (tax identification number)` starting with \"IG\" and a :abbr:`ROB (registration of business)` number, combine the TIN and ROB in the **TIN:ROB** format for the :guilabel:`Tax ID` field."
msgstr "Para los contribuyentes cuyo :abbr:`TIN (número de identificación fiscal)` comience con \"IG\" y que tengan un número de :abbr:`ROB (registro de empresa)`, combine el TIN y el ROB con el formato **TIN:ROB** en el campo :guilabel:`NIF`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:182
msgid "To register, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings`, and in the :guilabel:`Malaysian Electronic Invoicing` section, click :guilabel:`Register`. Once the registration is complete, the **:ROB** can be removed from the :guilabel:`Tax ID`."
msgstr "Para registrarse, vaya a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Ajustes` y, en la sección :guilabel:`Facturación electrónica de Malasia`, haga clic en :guilabel:`Registrar`. Una vez completado el registro, puede eliminar el **:ROB** del campo :guilabel:`NIF`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:186
msgid "Additionally, remember to log into `MyTax account <https://mytax.hasil.gov.my/>`_ and set the :guilabel:`Type of Role` as :guilabel:`Business Owner`."
msgstr "Además, recuerde iniciar sesión en su `cuenta de MyTax <https://mytax.hasil.gov.my/>`_ y establecer el :guilabel:`Tipo de rol` como :guilabel:`Propietario de la empresa`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:194
msgid "Access the contact's form and fill in the following fields:"
msgstr "Acceda al formulario del contacto y complete los siguientes campos:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:199
msgid ":guilabel:`Tax ID`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`NIF`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:200
msgid ":guilabel:`Identification`: the :guilabel:`ID Type` and the corresponding :guilabel:`Identification number` of the contact registered on MyTax."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Identificación`: el :guilabel:`Tipo de identificación` y el :guilabel:`número de identificación` correspondiente del contacto registrado en MyTax."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:208
msgid "All products to be included in e-invoices require a Malaysian classification code. To add it, access the :guilabel:`Product` form and in the :guilabel:`General Information` tab, fill in the :guilabel:`Malaysian classification code` field."
msgstr "Todos los productos que se incluyan en las facturas electrónicas requieren un código de clasificación de Malasia. Para añadirlo, acceda al formulario del :guilabel:`producto` y, en la pestaña :guilabel:`Información general`, complete el campo :guilabel:`Código de clasificación de Malasia`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:213
msgid "Malaysian tax type"
msgstr "Tipo de impuesto de Malasia"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:215
msgid "To configure a tax's :guilabel:`Malaysian Tax Type` field, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Accounting --> Taxes` and open the relevant tax in the :guilabel:`Taxes` list view."
msgstr "Para configurar el campo :guilabel:`Tipo de impuesto de Malasia` de un impuesto, vaya a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Configuración --> Contabilidad --> Impuestos` y abra el impuesto correspondiente en la vista de lista de :guilabel:`Impuestos`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:219
msgid "When an invoice or bill includes a tax with the :guilabel:`Malaysian Tax Type` set to **Tax Exempt**, a :guilabel:`Tax Exemption Reason` must be specified in the :guilabel:`MyInvois` tab before the document is sent."
msgstr "Cuando una factura o factura de proveedor incluye un impuesto con el :guilabel:`Tipo de impuesto de Malasia` establecido como **Exento de impuestos**, debe especificarse un :guilabel:`Motivo de exención fiscal` en la pestaña :guilabel:`MyInvois` antes de enviar el documento."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:239
msgid "Send invoices to MyInvois"
msgstr "Enviar facturas a MyInvois"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:241
msgid "Invoices can be sent to MyInvois once they have been confirmed. To do so, click :guilabel:`Send to MyInvois`."
msgstr "Las facturas se pueden enviar a MyInvois una vez confirmadas. Para ello, haga clic en :guilabel:`Enviar a MyInvois`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:245
msgid "Send bills to MyInvois"
msgstr "Enviar facturas de proveedor a MyInvois"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:247
msgid "Sending a bill to MyInvois is necessary when issuing an e-Invoice on behalf of a supplier. Once a bill is confirmed, click :guilabel:`Send To MyInvois`."
msgstr "Es necesario enviar una factura de proveedor a MyInvois al emitir una factura electrónica en nombre de un proveedor. Una vez confirmada la factura de proveedor, haga clic en :guilabel:`Enviar a MyInvois`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:251
msgid "In `MyInvois <https://preprod.myinvois.hasil.gov.my/content>`_, these vendor bills are categorized as :guilabel:`Self-billed Invoice`."
msgstr "En `MyInvois <https://preprod.myinvois.hasil.gov.my/content>`_, estas facturas de proveedor se clasifican como :guilabel:`Factura autofacturada`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:254
msgid "If a :guilabel:`Bill Reference` field is empty, Odoo's vendor bill number is used as the MyInvois number. If a reference is entered in the :guilabel:`Bill Reference` field, that reference is used instead."
msgstr "Si el campo :guilabel:`Referencia de la factura` está vacío, se utiliza el número de factura de proveedor de Odoo como número de MyInvois. Si se ingresa una referencia en el campo :guilabel:`Referencia de la factura`, se utiliza esa referencia en su lugar."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:261
msgid "MyInvois status"
msgstr "Estado de MyInvois"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:263
msgid "The current MyInvois status of an invoice or bill is shown in the :guilabel:`MyInvois State` field within the :guilabel:`MyInvois` tab."
msgstr "El estado actual de MyInvois de una factura o factura de proveedor se muestra en el campo :guilabel:`Estado de MyInvois` dentro de la pestaña :guilabel:`MyInvois`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:266
msgid ":guilabel:`Validation in Progress`: the validation is being processed by MyInvois. A blue :guilabel:`Processing` banner is also displayed."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Validación en curso`: MyInvois está procesando la validación. También se muestra un banner azul de :guilabel:`Procesando`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:268
msgid ":guilabel:`Valid`: it is validated by MyInvois. The :guilabel:`Submission UID`, :guilabel:`MyInvois` and :guilabel:`Validation Time` are automatically updated with information from MyInvois."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Válido`: MyInvois lo ha validado. El :guilabel:`UID de envío`, :guilabel:`MyInvois` y la :guilabel:`Hora de validación` se actualizan automáticamente con la información de MyInvois."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:281
msgid "Sent invoices can be canceled within 72 hours from :guilabel:`Validation time`. In this case, open the invoice and click :guilabel:`Request Cancel`. In the :guilabel:`Cancel document` window, include the cancellation :guilabel:`Reason`, then click :guilabel:`Update Invoice`. The :guilabel:`MyInvois State` is updated to :guilabel:`cancelled`."
msgstr "Las facturas enviadas se pueden cancelar dentro de las 72 horas siguientes a la :guilabel:`Hora de validación`. En ese caso, abra la factura y haga clic en :guilabel:`Solicitar cancelación`. En la ventana :guilabel:`Cancelar documento`, incluya el :guilabel:`Motivo` de la cancelación y, a continuación, haga clic en :guilabel:`Actualizar factura`. El :guilabel:`Estado de MyInvois` cambiará a :guilabel:`cancelado`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:287
msgid "Send credit notes to MyInvois"
msgstr "Enviar notas de crédito a MyInvois"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:289
msgid "Before sending a credit note, the original invoice must be successfully submitted to MyInvois. Otherwise, the credit note's :guilabel:`MyInvois State` is updated to :guilabel:`Invalid`."
msgstr "Antes de enviar una nota de crédito, la factura original debe haberse enviado correctamente a MyInvois. De lo contrario, el :guilabel:`Estado de MyInvois` de la nota de crédito cambiará a :guilabel:`No válido`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:292
msgid "While Odoo uses a single :guilabel:`credit note` document, MyInvois categorizes these into two types: :guilabel:`credit note` and :guilabel:`refund note`, depending on how they are reconciled."
msgstr "Aunque Odoo utiliza un único documento de :guilabel:`nota de crédito`, MyInvois las clasifica en dos tipos: :guilabel:`nota de crédito` y :guilabel:`nota de reembolso`, según cómo se concilien."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:295
msgid ":guilabel:`MyInvois Credit Note`: This is created when an Odoo credit note is reconciled with the original invoice."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Nota de crédito de MyInvois`: se crea cuando una nota de crédito de Odoo se concilia con la factura original."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:297
msgid ":guilabel:`MyInvois Refund Note`: This is created when an Odoo credit note is reconciled with a full payment instead of the original invoice."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Nota de reembolso de MyInvois`: se crea cuando una nota de crédito de Odoo se concilia con un pago completo en lugar de con la factura original."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:301
msgid "If a credit note is reconciled with only a partial payment before being sent, it is still categorized as a :guilabel:`credit note` in MyInvois."
msgstr "Si una nota de crédito se concilia únicamente con un pago parcial antes de enviarla, MyInvois seguirá clasificándola como :guilabel:`nota de crédito`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:307
msgid "To issue both a credit note and a refund note for the same original invoice:"
msgstr "Para emitir tanto una nota de crédito como una nota de reembolso para la misma factura original:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:306
msgid "Create two separate credit notes in Odoo from the original invoice."
msgstr "Cree dos notas de crédito independientes en Odoo a partir de la factura original."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:307
msgid "For a MyInvois :guilabel:`Refund Note`: Register a payment before sending it."
msgstr "Para una :guilabel:`nota de reembolso` de MyInvois: registre un pago antes de enviarla."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:308
msgid "For a MyInvois :guilabel:`Credit Note`: Do not register a payment before sending it."
msgstr "Para una :guilabel:`nota de crédito` de MyInvois: no registre un pago antes de enviarla."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:311
msgid "The same logic applies to credit notes created from bills: if reconciled with a full payment, the credit note becomes a :guilabel:`Self-billed Refund Note`; otherwise, it becomes a :guilabel:`Self-billed Credit Note`."
msgstr "La misma lógica se aplica a las notas de crédito creadas a partir de facturas de proveedor: si se concilian con un pago completo, la nota de crédito se convierte en una :guilabel:`Nota de reembolso autofacturada`; de lo contrario, se convierte en una :guilabel:`Nota de crédito autofacturada`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:316
msgid "Send debit notes to MyInvois"
msgstr "Enviar notas de débito a MyInvois"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:318
msgid ":ref:`Issue a debit note from an existing bill or invoice <accounting/credit_notes/issue-debit-note>` and click :guilabel:`Send To MyInvois`. In MyInvois, it appears then as a :guilabel:`Debit Note` if issued from an invoice or a :guilabel:`Self-billed Debit Note` from a vendor bill."
msgstr ":ref:`Emita una nota de débito desde una factura de proveedor o una factura existente <accounting/credit_notes/issue-debit-note>` y haga clic en :guilabel:`Enviar a MyInvois`. En MyInvois, aparecerá como :guilabel:`Nota de débito` si se emite desde una factura o como :guilabel:`Nota de débito autofacturada` si se emite desde una factura de proveedor."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:323
msgid "Access invoices via QR code"
msgstr "Acceder a las facturas mediante código QR"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:325
msgid "When a document is successfully submitted to MyInvois, a QR code is added to its PDF version. Scanning this code links directly to the validated document in MyInvois."
msgstr "Cuando un documento se envía correctamente a MyInvois, se añade un código QR a su versión en PDF. Al escanear este código se accede directamente al documento validado en MyInvois."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:328
msgid "To download the PDF from an invoice or bill:"
msgstr "Para descargar el PDF de una factura o factura de proveedor:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:330
msgid "Click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(gear)` icon"
msgstr "Haga clic en el icono :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(engranaje)`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:331
msgid "Select :guilabel:`Download`"
msgstr "Seleccione :guilabel:`Descargar`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:332
msgid "Choose either :guilabel:`PDF` or :guilabel:`PDF without Payment`"
msgstr "Elija :guilabel:`PDF` o :guilabel:`PDF sin pago`"

