#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:59
msgid "If the contact is identified as a branch, input the **Branch number** in the :guilabel:`Company ID` field."
msgstr "Si el contacto es una filial, introduzca el **número de filial** en el campo :guilabel:`ID de la empresa`.  "

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/thailand.rst:61
