#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:104
msgid "Predefined accounts are included in Odoo, as part of the |CoA| that's installed with the US localization package. The accounts listed below are preconfigured to perform certain operations within Odoo. It is recommended to **not** delete these accounts; however, if changes are needed, rename the accounts instead."
