#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/nav_online_invoice.rst:68
msgid ":guilabel:`Automatically post Credit Note`: credit notes created with the :guilabel:`Credit Note` button are confirmed (and therefore reported) immediately."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Automatically post Credit Note`: las notas de crédito creadas con el botón :guilabel:`Credit Note` se confirman (y por lo tanto se comunican) de inmediato."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/nav_online_invoice.rst:72
msgid "Reporting invoices"
msgstr "Envío de facturas"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/nav_online_invoice.rst:74
msgid "When a customer invoice, corrective invoice or credit note is **confirmed**, Odoo first checks the :ref:`mandatory data <localizations/hungary/invoice-checks>`, then queues the data report. The report is sent by a background job about one minute later and is retried every five minutes until NAV accepts it. Nothing else has to be done by the user."
msgstr "Cuando se **confirma** una factura de cliente, una factura rectificativa o una nota de crédito, Odoo primero comprueba los :ref:`datos obligatorios <localizations/hungary/invoice-checks>` y después pone en cola el envío de datos. El informe se envía mediante un trabajo en segundo plano aproximadamente un minuto después y se reintenta cada cinco minutos hasta que la NAV lo acepta. El usuario no tiene que hacer nada más."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/nav_online_invoice.rst:79
msgid "The :guilabel:`NAV` tab of the invoice shows the result:"
msgstr "La pestaña :guilabel:`NAV` de la factura muestra el resultado:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/nav_online_invoice.rst:81
msgid ":guilabel:`NAV Sending Date` and :guilabel:`NAV Sending State` (*Beküldés folyamatban* while the report is waiting to be sent);"
msgstr ":guilabel:`NAV Sending Date` y :guilabel:`NAV Sending State` (*Beküldés folyamatban* mientras el informe espera ser enviado);"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/nav_online_invoice.rst:83
msgid ":guilabel:`NAV Processing State`: `RECEIVED`, `PROCESSING`, `SAVED`, `DONE` (accepted) or `ABORTED` (rejected);"
msgstr ":guilabel:`NAV Processing State`: `RECEIVED`, `PROCESSING`, `SAVED`, `DONE` (aceptado) o `ABORTED` (rechazado);"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/nav_online_invoice.rst:85
msgid ":guilabel:`NAV Transaction ID` and :guilabel:`NAV Response` (warnings and error messages of NAV);"
msgstr ":guilabel:`NAV Transaction ID` y :guilabel:`NAV Response` (advertencias y mensajes de error de la NAV);"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/nav_online_invoice.rst:86
msgid ":guilabel:`NAV Submitted XML`: the data that was sent;"
msgstr ":guilabel:`NAV Submitted XML`: los datos que se enviaron;"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/nav_online_invoice.rst:87
msgid ":guilabel:`No need to hand it over to the NAV!` and :guilabel:`It did not have to be submitted to the NAV for the following reasons:` if the invoice was not reported."
msgstr ":guilabel:`No need to hand it over to the NAV!` y :guilabel:`It did not have to be submitted to the NAV for the following reasons:` si la factura no se comunicó."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/nav_online_invoice.rst:90
msgid "The :guilabel:`NAV Processing State` is also displayed as a colored badge in the customer invoice and credit note lists, so rejected reports are easy to find."
msgstr "El :guilabel:`NAV Processing State` también se muestra como una insignia de color en las listas de facturas de cliente y notas de crédito, de modo que los informes rechazados son fáciles de encontrar."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/nav_online_invoice.rst:101
msgid "An `ABORTED` report means that NAV refused the data (the reason is in :guilabel:`NAV Response`). Correct the cause (typically master data such as the tax number or address of the customer, or the NAV settings of a tax group); the report is sent again automatically. In :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>`, the :guilabel:`NAV` tab also offers the buttons :guilabel:`Send to NAV`, :guilabel:`Immediately Send to NAV`, :guilabel:`Check State`, :guilabel:`Get from NAV`, :guilabel:`Get Invoice Chain from NAV` and :guilabel:`Link storno to original` for administrators."
msgstr "Un informe `ABORTED` significa que la NAV rechazó los datos (el motivo aparece en :guilabel:`NAV Response`). Corrija la causa (normalmente datos maestros como el número fiscal o la dirección del cliente, o los ajustes de NAV de un grupo de impuestos); el informe se vuelve a enviar de forma automática. En :ref:`modo de desarrollador <developer-mode>`, la pestaña :guilabel:`NAV` también ofrece a los administradores los botones :guilabel:`Send to NAV`, :guilabel:`Immediately Send to NAV`, :guilabel:`Check State`, :guilabel:`Get from NAV`, :guilabel:`Get Invoice Chain from NAV` y :guilabel:`Link storno to original`."

