#~ msgid "an *entries type* filter, as indicated by a :icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`(filter)` icon, with the default setting of :guilabel:`Posted Entries Only, Accrual Basis`. Use this filter to determine which type of journal entries should be included in the report (e.g. posted or draft), along with the type of accounting method (e.g. accrual or cash basis)."
